#: ../../source/docs/common-hondex-sonar.rst:21
#: 2c9e1df79d6f4cfc8e73194ece8257f7
msgid "Connecting and Configuring"
msgstr "连接与配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hondex-sonar.rst:23
#: 4ddf0fd52d3941ffa43f4c4e6b40bdd3
msgid ""
"The sonar provides distance measurements using the NMEA protocol over serial"
" at 9600 baud.  There should be a port on the back of the sonar labelled "
"\"NMEA\" with a DB9 connector."
msgstr "声呐通过串口以 9600 波特率输出 NMEA 协议的距离测量数据。声呐背面应有一个标有 「NMEA」 的 DB9 接口端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hondex-sonar.rst:25
#: 2a4a6814bb36456293ef50a1512ef4cd
msgid ""
"The sonar's DB9 connector should be wired to the RS232-to-Serial converter "
"board as shown below.  Note that the sonar's DB9 port's pin2 and pin3 are "
"connected to the converter board's pin3 and pin2 (i.e. crossed).  The "
"converter board's serial output can be connected to any available serial "
"port on the autopilot.  In the diagram below the SERIAL2 is used."
msgstr ""
"声呐的 DB9 接口应如下图所示连接到 RS232 转串口转换板。注意声呐 DB9 端口的引脚 2 和引脚 3 分别连接到转换板的引脚 3 和引脚 "
"2（即交叉连接）。转换板的串行输出可连接到飞控上任意可用的串口。下图使用的是 SERIAL2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hondex-sonar.rst:30
#: 61dabf8e438d44e48467c29f5ec14c3c
msgid "If the SERIAL2 is used then the following parameters should be set:"
msgstr "如果使用 SERIAL2，则应设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-hondex-sonar.rst:32
#: 93233f5f306143629fbf7e24c37478fe
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9 (Lidar)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9（激光雷达）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hondex-sonar.rst:33
#: af8568d47bc34ce991207d9f4ed4f132
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 9 (9600 baud)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 9（9600 波特率）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hondex-sonar.rst:35
#: 94d5388b4c2c4f409f835a38607cc7b9
msgid "The following range finder related parameters should also be set:"
msgstr "还应设置以下测距仪相关参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-hondex-sonar.rst:37
#: a9c925a844f34d2ba6574cc5bef18b10
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 17 (NMEA)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 17（NMEA）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hondex-sonar.rst:38
#: 5dae7a9e684e482198162a5583a95885
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.13"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.13"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hondex-sonar.rst:39
#: 7771a08cdcb64d91a3fef93c49e415b8
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 100 (i.e. 100m).  *This is the distance "
"in meters that the rangefinder can reliably read.*"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 100（即 100m）。*这是测距仪可靠读取的最大距离，单位为米。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hondex-sonar.rst:40
#: da7c757133c4446caacacc512ccbc256
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT <RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = 25 (i.e. down) if mounted on a boat"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT <RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = 25（即向下），如果安装在船上"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hondex-sonar.rst:43
#: ae092848cca44a279a0352d5d3c0add7
msgid "Testing the sensor"
msgstr "测试传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hondex-sonar.rst:45
#: 1c2de3fad4f946d4b5902ab34c6c8d5a
msgid ""
"Distances read by the sensor can be seen in the Mission Planner's Flight "
"Data screen's Status tab. Look closely for \"rangefinder1\"."
msgstr "传感器读取的距离可在 Mission Planner 飞行数据界面的状态标签页中查看。请注意查找 「rangefinder1」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hondex-sonar.rst:51
#: 49d6c5e3932c4e35a24e217230cb18bb
msgid ""
"More info on NMEA message contents can be found `here "
"<http://www.catb.org/gpsd/NMEA.html>`__"
msgstr "有关 NMEA 消息内容的更多信息，请参见 `此处 <http://www.catb.org/gpsd/NMEA.html>`__"
